OL,3,GNEWSATitanic insurance document could
OL,4,Afetch #50,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe only known copy of an insurance
OL,7,Fledger covering the hull of the RMS
OL,8,FTitanic during its sea trials is to be
OL,9,Fsold at auction.
OL,11,FThe policy provides $100,000 worth of
OL,12,Finsurance coverage to the steel hull
OL,13,Funder the Atlantic Mutual Insurance
OL,14,FCompany, one of the ship's major
OL,15,Finsurers.
OL,17,FThe binder was signed on 27 March 1912
OL,18,F- just 19 days before the ship sank
OL,19,Fduring its maiden voyage to New York,
OL,20,Fclaiming the lives of 1,500 people on
OL,21,Fboard. The policy limits were paid
OL,22,Fwithin 30 days of the sinking.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
