OL,3,GNEWSATitanic insurance document could
OL,4,Afetch #50,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will go under the hammer at Henry
OL,7,FAldridge and Son auctioneers in Devizes
OL,8,Fin Wiltshire on 21 November, with an
OL,9,Festimated sale price of #30,000 to
OL,10,F#50,000.
